66
00:07:20,680 --> 00:07:21,759
No one followed me.

67
00:07:22,519 --> 00:07:23,639
The cops have cases to deal with
every day.

68
00:07:23,839 --> 00:07:25,199
They don't have time to follow eveyone.

69
00:07:25,720 --> 00:07:26,079
Close.

70
