82
00:08:03,360 --> 00:08:04,439
Don't worry. No one follows us.

83
00:08:05,680 --> 00:08:06,879
Try to eat something.

84
00:08:08,439 --> 00:08:10,360
The old home, the factory,

85
00:08:11,600 --> 00:08:12,560
all the places

86
