93
00:08:23,920 --> 00:08:24,720
They won't.

94
00:08:25,600 --> 00:08:27,519
Mr. Gu's alive.

95
00:08:27,839 --> 00:08:28,759
He was only injured.

96
00:08:29,000 --> 00:08:29,959
You're okay now.

97
00:08:34,320 --> 00:08:35,799
Is that good or bad?

98
00:08:36,039 --> 00:08:36,840
Good, of course.

99
00:08:37,360 --> 00:08:38,200
We'll go see him.

100
00:08:38,360 --> 00:08:39,240
Offer him some money.

101
00:08:39,360 --> 00:08:40,240
Talk it out.

102
00:08:40,960 --> 00:08:41,959
Then you'll be fine.

103
00:08:41,960 --> 00:08:43,120
You won't have to hide here.

104
00:08:43,840 --> 00:08:44,559
No, no.

105
00:08:46,440 --> 00:08:48,279
I still committed assault.

106
00:08:49,360 --> 00:08:51,000
I have to wait until Na is found.

107
00:08:51,919 --> 00:08:52,759
Then I'll turn myself in.

108
00:08:54,879 --> 00:08:55,519
How...

109
00:08:58,639 --> 00:09:00,159
How did it come to this?

110
00:09:05,399 --> 00:09:06,080
Don't worry.

111
00:09:07,360 --> 00:09:08,480
It'll all pass.

112
00:09:12,919 --> 00:09:14,960
If anything happens to Na,

113
00:09:18,759 --> 00:09:20,360
I'll never forgive myself.

114
00:09:22,519 --> 00:09:24,159
I feel like from the very start,

115
00:09:26,120 --> 00:09:27,679
I was the one who got it wrong.

116
00:09:30,559 --> 00:09:31,879
What did Professor Qiao say?

117
00:09:32,519 --> 00:09:33,919
He thinks some parts

118
00:09:34,360 --> 00:09:35,440
