121
00:09:42,320 --> 00:09:43,200
The disposal sites

122
00:09:45,360 --> 00:09:47,240
were places the killer knew best.

123
00:09:48,720 --> 00:09:50,359
The crime area was also

124
00:09:50,360 --> 00:09:52,080
one of the key areas he helped identify.

125
00:09:54,080 --> 00:09:57,519
(Chaobei Weather, Apr-Aug 1993)
Zhou Xijie fits our profile best.

126
00:09:58,720 --> 00:09:59,798
And yet,

127
00:09:59,799 --> 00:10:02,104
(Female, height: 164 cm)
Zhou Xijie ran over the drifter.

128
00:10:02,105 --> 00:10:04,445
(Perpetrator's semen detected,
clear ligature marks on neck)

129
00:10:04,960 --> 00:10:06,679
I don't believe it's just a coincidence.

130
00:10:07,279 --> 00:10:09,000
I see the issues too,

131
00:10:09,480 --> 00:10:10,879
but I'm not going to speculate.

132
00:10:12,440 --> 00:10:14,480
I went through

133
00:10:14,600 --> 00:10:15,519
all the case files.

134
00:10:16,279 --> 00:10:18,240
Let's go over everything
from start to finish.

135
00:10:18,550 --> 00:10:19,079
(Victim's semen sample)

136
00:10:19,080 --> 00:10:20,320
(matches the drifter's DNA.)
Focus on the key gaps

137
00:10:20,799 --> 00:10:21,840
and find evidence.

138
00:10:23,919 --> 00:10:26,518
I've also alerted several stations

139
00:10:26,519 --> 00:10:27,360
across the city.

140
00:10:28,639 --> 00:10:30,809
Have them focus on finding Su Lin.

141
00:10:30,810 --> 00:10:32,239
(DNA Comparison Report)

142
00:10:32,240 --> 00:10:33,799
(Name: Su Lin)
She could be our break.

143
00:10:48,159 --> 00:10:49,360
Mom.

144
00:10:50,799 --> 00:10:51,720
Mom.

145
00:10:55,639 --> 00:10:57,759
