148
00:11:07,679 --> 00:11:09,159
She's been gone a long time.

149
00:11:24,840 --> 00:11:25,799
(Mom.)

150
00:11:30,919 --> 00:11:31,919
(Mom.)

151
00:11:34,440 --> 00:11:35,360
Mom.

152
00:11:36,679 --> 00:11:37,919
Mom.

153
00:11:49,559 --> 00:11:50,519
Don't move.

154
00:11:52,039 --> 00:11:53,480
