155
00:12:05,080 --> 00:12:07,320
Please... let me go.

156
00:12:13,960 --> 00:12:14,959
I'm begging you.

157
00:12:14,960 --> 00:12:16,360
Please, can you let me go?

158
00:12:24,559 --> 00:12:25,638
I'm begging you.

159
00:12:25,639 --> 00:12:26,360
Please.

160
00:12:26,519 --> 00:12:27,600
I'm begging you.

161
00:12:27,759 --> 00:12:29,039
I'm begging you.

162
00:12:46,720 --> 00:12:47,360
One.

163
00:12:48,519 --> 00:12:49,159
Two.

164
00:12:50,559 --> 00:12:51,279
Three.

165
00:12:52,360 --> 00:12:53,000
Four.

166
00:12:54,240 --> 00:12:54,960
Five.

167
00:12:56,279 --> 00:12:57,039
Six.

168
00:12:58,720 --> 00:12:59,519
Seven.

169
00:13:33,240 --> 00:13:33,720
Who's there?

170
00:13:37,720 --> 00:13:38,360
Come out!

171
00:13:48,519 --> 00:13:49,159
Su Lin.

172
00:13:52,720 --> 00:13:53,720
