206
00:15:44,799 --> 00:15:46,159
They'd never abandon you.

207
00:15:46,639 --> 00:15:47,960
Come with me.

208
00:15:48,159 --> 00:15:49,518
Once you all sit down together,

209
00:15:49,519 --> 00:15:50,599
