217
00:16:07,120 --> 00:16:08,360
You want to go to college, right?

218
00:16:08,799 --> 00:16:10,759
Ms. Du and I will put you through college.

219
00:16:10,919 --> 00:16:12,879
We'll raise you like our own daughter.

220
00:16:13,039 --> 00:16:13,799
Is it okay?

221
00:16:26,600 --> 00:16:27,240
Su Lin.

222
00:16:28,799 --> 00:16:30,440
Did you hear what I said?

223
00:16:32,480 --> 00:16:33,360
Is it okay?

224
00:16:34,279 --> 00:16:35,120
Answer me.

225
00:16:36,960 --> 00:16:37,919
What you're saying

226
00:16:40,600 --> 00:16:41,519
