227
00:16:50,720 --> 00:16:51,320
Su Lin.

228
00:16:52,559 --> 00:16:53,480
Answer me.

229
00:16:59,639 --> 00:17:00,279
Mr. Gu.

230
00:17:03,919 --> 00:17:04,599
My brother...

231
00:17:07,119 --> 00:17:07,839
Is he okay?

232
00:17:08,839 --> 00:17:09,400
He's okay.

233
00:17:11,839 --> 00:17:13,160
He came back looking for me,

234
00:17:13,559 --> 00:17:14,799
