235
00:17:16,440 --> 00:17:17,640
He regretted it so much.

236
00:17:18,880 --> 00:17:20,919
He thought he'd made you angry.

237
00:17:20,920 --> 00:17:21,839
That's why you left.

238
00:17:24,000 --> 00:17:25,240
He's back in school now.

239
00:17:27,920 --> 00:17:29,160
Listen to me.

240
00:17:30,400 --> 00:17:32,319
I'm not the only one looking for you.

241
00:17:33,200 --> 00:17:34,960
Your parents are looking for you too.

242
00:17:35,720 --> 00:17:38,318
A girl at your school, Jiang Ting,

243
00:17:38,319 --> 00:17:39,079
