245
00:17:41,799 --> 00:17:43,640
Jiang Ting came down here with me.

246
00:17:43,799 --> 00:17:45,440
Her mom came here too.

247
00:17:45,599 --> 00:17:46,798
The place where you were staying.

248
00:17:46,799 --> 00:17:48,400
we found it together.

249
00:17:49,000 --> 00:17:51,358
And a boy in your class

250
00:17:51,359 --> 00:17:52,439
is looking for you too.

251
00:17:52,440 --> 00:17:54,639
Do you know how many people
are worried about you?

252
00:17:54,640 --> 00:17:56,200
How many are looking for you?

253
00:17:56,640 --> 00:17:57,160
Come on.

254
00:17:57,559 --> 00:17:58,519
Come here. Come on.

255
00:17:59,440 --> 00:18:00,319
Come back with me.

256
00:18:09,240 --> 00:18:10,160
I want to go with you.

257
00:18:13,839 --> 00:18:14,880
But not now.

258
00:18:17,680 --> 00:18:18,359
Why?

259
00:18:19,400 --> 00:18:21,359
I have something important to do.

260
00:18:24,200 --> 00:18:24,759
Mr. Gu.

261
00:18:26,200 --> 00:18:27,079
I promise.

262
00:18:28,240 --> 00:18:29,720
Once I've done it,

263
00:18:30,200 --> 00:18:31,319
I'll come find you.

264
00:18:31,599 --> 00:18:32,518
