265
00:18:32,519 --> 00:18:33,318
Tell me.

266
00:18:33,319 --> 00:18:34,199
I can help you.

267
00:18:34,200 --> 00:18:34,880
No.

268
00:18:37,480 --> 00:18:39,119
I have to do this myself.

269
00:18:53,680 --> 00:18:54,480
Su Lin.

270
00:19:01,160 --> 00:19:01,720
Mr. Gu.

271
00:19:03,799 --> 00:19:04,559
Thank you.

272
00:19:06,440 --> 00:19:07,640
I'll leave the flashlight.

273
00:19:08,079 --> 00:19:09,359
Please wait until I'm gone,

274
00:19:09,519 --> 00:19:10,039
