275
00:19:10,400 --> 00:19:11,000
Thank you.

276
00:19:11,680 --> 00:19:12,319
Su Lin.

277
00:19:15,000 --> 00:19:15,759
Su Lin!

278
00:19:17,400 --> 00:19:18,119
Su Lin!

279
00:19:19,880 --> 00:19:21,079
Su Lin, don't go!

280
00:19:23,759 --> 00:19:24,680
Su Lin!

281
00:19:25,920 --> 00:19:27,400
Come back with me!

282
00:19:30,079 --> 00:19:32,640
Kid, it took me so long to find you.

283
00:19:34,920 --> 00:19:35,680
Su Lin!

284
00:19:38,720 --> 00:19:39,920
Listen to me!

285
00:19:42,119 --> 00:19:43,200
Come back with me!

286
00:19:47,119 --> 00:19:48,279
Su Lin, don't leave!

287
00:19:50,119 --> 00:19:51,319
Come on, kid!

288
00:20:09,039 --> 00:20:09,480
Hello?

289
00:20:09,799 --> 00:20:10,160
Hello.

290
00:20:10,279 --> 00:20:10,880
Tai Wei?

291
00:20:11,200 --> 00:20:12,000
Listen.

